{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>金曲歌王林俊傑認愛小21歲美籍華裔網紅女友「七七」，但女方慘遭抹黑造謠，連帶家人隱私也被洩漏，七七父親更被傳疑似是「經濟犯」。</p><p>11日七七正式提告，林俊傑也發聲力挺女友。</p><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑認愛小21歲美籍華裔網紅女友「七七」，但女方慘遭抹黑造謠，連帶家人隱私也被洩漏，11日七七正式提告，林俊傑也發聲力挺。（IG@jjlin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142049405193424896462759.jpeg/6RB8zgabBgeTrIBhE6n-9dXS2aWAuuG2eyZwHnsmcB4\"/><figcaption>林俊傑認愛小21歲美籍華裔網紅女友「七七」，但女方慘遭抹黑造謠，連帶家人隱私也被洩漏，11日七七正式提告，林俊傑也發聲力挺。（IG@jjlin）</figcaption></figure><p>更多林俊傑和女友七七照片：</p><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑（右二）PO出與女友七七（左ㄧ）一家四口同框合照。（IG@jjlin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260102/1083810349754355712702594.jpeg/4eWpBxQVMf1OmXibh_VlsydBFfhhCDBWy6XG6Mulxug\"/><figcaption>林俊傑（右二）PO出與女友七七（左ㄧ）一家四口同框合照。（IG@jjlin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260102/1083811323504496640572863.jpeg/PJSEQ8BpqVIE91cFAMUM7oKJsCysShkIsQt75rELe-Y\"/><figcaption>網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑（IG@jjlin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250508/997106073091444736630152.png/T0BK4_mWsyAi3k-UN1hISWuBATcKafAEVN7xhlTe8YY\"/><figcaption>林俊傑（IG@jjlin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網紅女友七七提告造謠者。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142052385779224576386015.jpeg/haxO6T2xjAw2U5zYpr3O8JoMxMMcFDIeeQhyq3kIcqs\"/><figcaption>網紅女友七七提告造謠者。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網紅女友七七提告造謠者。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142052383455449088128530.jpeg/cVy69QatNtUa9V6H2XSZiBbc0rWVkOq-We0knFntJJw\"/><figcaption>網紅女友七七提告造謠者。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260102/1083811314280697856307148.jpeg/fRMw6Y0smslvSdqLxQi0E9PxmEpR4HskhjKJ_IYyifw\"/><figcaption>網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260102/1083811322598395904193265.jpeg/-OmulWUobsTJhNFx7wUT_P6vj126uhvAVwQQ4FcEEOA\"/><figcaption>網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260102/1083811321470128128865702.jpeg/Cx4A6ImO25mzK5Ito4p3H8p7TqtWYa6yyzpHZcs6R2U\"/><figcaption>網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260102/1083811324972503040385917.jpeg/XXJVtsyTCf4qz0Vay4svBvGnYQlK9SWdemqTWnpqk1o\"/><figcaption>網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260102/1083811316898074624204731.jpeg/qsTCkhqwEQAtNF02E6Tgkn7h-tVmdLL1d1C_2XdQv9k\"/><figcaption>網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260102/1083811318861139968326415.jpeg/oppakhsjN0jxaJBcXdu2ot4tojKqfHh8bq_9tG6v_bQ\"/><figcaption>網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260102/1083811319028912128132970.jpeg/Jl4Ds_Klk8gsC5i0ElsJvk3eBOeutbj5gYg6RoGIOkY\"/><figcaption>網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260102/1083811318630453248281097.jpeg/U69L-8KP9q8WDePnJ_Qp5bl1gBOkPZ3xLTT7oS00-6E\"/><figcaption>網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260102/1083811321713397760948653.jpeg/fwWl9VVNO_n4t9eHmuQp83YCnKcTe3nb7rjWLu641i4\"/><figcaption>網紅女友七七Annalisa（IG@annalisaqiqi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑（JJ）。（微博＠林俊傑）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250714/1021370568080887808648023.jpeg/TZxJHfHXyiyJdV9z9xOM9ZKjscAujneCNkwMITZMDCE\"/><figcaption>林俊傑（JJ）。（微博＠林俊傑）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑（IG@jjlin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250508/997106079630757888798014.png/XB3H__IR0d0uaaBMwbFGDMhsLbUZLEkDt7EpT7exKU8\"/><figcaption>林俊傑（IG@jjlin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑（IG@jjlin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250525/1003341685461225472948620.png/qadVHUExhj8NQBANUw2vNLehbLi21gwQ-DgisPg4IrA\"/><figcaption>林俊傑（IG@jjlin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑（IG@jjlin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250508/997106082738868224507469.png/RzmToZvHDkRWbfladoJ18BD6jBoIR6ttTI9S1kyPUtY\"/><figcaption>林俊傑（IG@jjlin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑（IG@jjlin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250508/997106080045993984736014.png/L-GSMLDrsj4AYzqOac5AI5bQ8cYMsMh3PutqnT7rap0\"/><figcaption>林俊傑（IG@jjlin）</figcaption></figure><p>七七以本名「劉偲敔」正式向造謠網友發起民事、行政、刑事訴訟，她自從去（2025）年2月起遭網友在各大社群造謠是「擦邊網黃」、私下從事性交易的「外圍女」且欠錢不還，加上同年底因林俊傑公開戀情，有網友自稱是七七的同學，透過P圖持續散播不實訊息。</p><p>七七遭抹黑長達1年多，近來已對造謠相關帳號提起司法訴訟，堅決追討公開道歉以及精神損害慰撫金等，強調絕不姑息，林俊傑也透過公司回應：</p><p>和女友站在同一陣線，力挺七七討回公道。</p><p>【延伸閱讀】45歲林俊傑現身23歲女友七七畢業典禮　女友作品曝光引發脫粉潮（點圖放大瀏覽▼▼▼）</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀】45歲林俊傑現身23歲女友七七畢業典禮　女友作品曝光引發脫粉潮（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133429019585417216620158.png/EWEaaUg43z7BIDGwx15mok1JlWLAnTSKRDANEEQwDRA\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀】45歲林俊傑現身23歲女友七七畢業典禮　女友作品曝光引發脫粉潮（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑（JJ）日前現身美國紐約，出席23歲網紅女友「七七」畢業典禮。林俊傑首日身穿筆挺西裝亮相，翌日典禮則改戴棒球帽低調露面。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133429017081286656428163.png/eGgUGLLXlB3Gxq4yOrvXh4BsgCuVgWMQSHKn6Uhyp-k\"/><figcaption>林俊傑（JJ）日前現身美國紐約，出席23歲網紅女友「七七」畢業典禮。林俊傑首日身穿筆挺西裝亮相，翌日典禮則改戴棒球帽低調露面。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"頭戴Cap帽低調現身。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133431253262143488107524.jpeg/5SLOF5CwIasNRYGhOalofJvjR1FdhiDRifTLt4n0y7c\"/><figcaption>頭戴Cap帽低調現身。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"向畢業生方向揮手。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133431251303272448860945.jpeg/GYPYRMitL6BKzjBcNMdCi88wG-cxqkBhXir7-F4q-_g\"/><figcaption>向畢業生方向揮手。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"提前離場。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133431249013051392742305.png/1tgiQtqYKrrCck7AQVYQJIdQxd0i7PczNgBEaDYARGg\"/><figcaption>提前離場。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑同媽媽前往紐約。（微博@林俊傑）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133707534742327296148079.jpeg/IHWDDaxstWmt7dASqpCALtNFuTtowaux-pNA2vqTQNo\"/><figcaption>林俊傑同媽媽前往紐約。（微博@林俊傑）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑早前慶祝生日時，身旁不見七七的身影。（IG@jjlin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133431621400137728679381.jpeg/3PflZ1Ll_WmmZGEER7wcC8ljzxtN735TVUvoFFVL6BQ\"/><figcaption>林俊傑早前慶祝生日時，身旁不見七七的身影。（IG@jjlin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑日前曬出圖片被眼利的網民認出背景正是七七在紐約的豪宅。（微博@林俊傑）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133432156278755328265480.jpeg/15NzZ0KYrrkGfoDocMNPOSQ4Huo-O0cYM9JK8zPSSvM\"/><figcaption>林俊傑日前曬出圖片被眼利的網民認出背景正是七七在紐約的豪宅。（微博@林俊傑）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑（右二）PO出與女友七七（左一）一家四口同框合照。（IG@jjlin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260102/1083810349754355712702594.jpeg/4eWpBxQVMf1OmXibh_VlsydBFfhhCDBWy6XG6Mulxug\"/><figcaption>林俊傑（右二）PO出與女友七七（左一）一家四口同框合照。（IG@jjlin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑曬出和女友七七合照。（微博@林俊傑）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133707705115086848032746.jpeg/EewJvQ-Gcajgm1mT3B4e9nZtuYVrO4YuFnuhxhZ7ocY\"/><figcaption>林俊傑曬出和女友七七合照。（微博@林俊傑）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女友七七畢業。（微博@林俊傑）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133707702271217664157043.jpeg/4bCP3JPjy_vKyvJU4Q4cTydt9xHoP74xLM6NuyzOjbs\"/><figcaption>女友七七畢業。（微博@林俊傑）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"七七於帕森斯設計學院畢業。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133433386057076736497381.jpeg/-UUllurgLVfddakggDbbp7aw7dAqH0d8jet9-43rffs\"/><figcaption>七七於帕森斯設計學院畢業。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"七七的畢業作品引發林俊傑粉絲吐槽。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133434207612178432469831.jpeg/4QiqJ3Qy-VdVHkXr47e6U-_ZQucAHYklWiRI21okSNs\"/><figcaption>七七的畢業作品引發林俊傑粉絲吐槽。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑IG評論區。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133435740919828480589320.png/yAVyLz1trMGXioVQQcwYRG6s4tloCj6swTTScsE00nI\"/><figcaption>林俊傑IG評論區。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑IG評論區。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133435738642190336385701.png/a2F3MAG4EQwoz_ZSHAEK48pnIdRxikzCe5tELnubRC4\"/><figcaption>林俊傑IG評論區。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>林俊傑女友怒了！七七遭抹黑「外圍女」還欠錢　大動作提告：絕不姑息</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-12T05:38:27.132747+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1369,"images":35,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}